Z||000003||mrfixit58||11-15-2001||03:23 PM||||I'll be there. I targeting Friday. Too many people on Saturday. Unfortunately, there won't be too may Fiero parts -- if any. Mostly hot rod and muscle car parts. I'm looking for a couple of items for my 68 Camaro. If you like cars, this is the place to be.<P>Alex - It at the Daytona Speedway (same as the spring show). It starts Thanksgiving day and runs through Sunday. I don't think there are any Fiero club events at this one. This is a HUGE swap meet. About 1/3 larger then the spring show.<BR>||||reg||14
